WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.589 line:-1
Property managers, be honest.

00:02.858 --> 00:05.296 line:-1
Your dumpster has become the hottest club in town.

00:08.076 --> 00:09.736 line:-1
And every complaint rings your office.

00:13.093 --> 00:16.100 line:-1
With Loaded Valet Trash, residents set the can outside the door,

00:16.100 --> 00:19.111 line:-1
bag inside, extra bag on top. Never a loose bag on the ground.

00:19.191 --> 00:22.674 line:-1
Our porters pick up at every opted-in door, Monday through Friday evenings,

00:23.578 --> 00:25.470 line:-1
straight to your compactor, same night.

00:26.236 --> 00:28.814 line:-1
Residents opt in through your office, billed with rent.

00:28.995 --> 00:29.599 line:-1
Move-outs?

00:32.708 --> 00:35.266 line:-1
Party or event cleanup? We handle that too.

00:36.671 --> 00:40.866 line:-1
Loaded Valet Trash. Call (229) 595-8852.
